Project lineage: JA21 Blank Virtual Console, the 9.8.7 presenter ABI,
retained HERMIT/SPIRAL virtual command components, compatible Generic
Photon 0.2.0 data, and the JP300 Windows-native integration source.
Existing executable names, protocol identifiers and schema identifiers
remain compatibility names; the new project name does not change their
wire or storage formats.

The current project-owned GPL grant supersedes prior restrictive terms
for the rights holder's included material. Historical HERMIT attribution
is preserved in licenses/HERMIT-HISTORICAL-NOTICE.txt. Original JA21 and
Photon attribution remains in the corresponding licenses and notices.

The current main branch distributes corresponding project source, compiled
application/test executables, Microsoft SDK adapters and the complete Fixed
Version browser payload. The oversized msedge.dll is stored as numbered raw
parts under payload/webview2; BOOT.cmd restores the exact DLL offline.
Earlier source-only tags retain their original source-only archive layout.
Historical private packages, certificates, keys, active configuration and
user state remain excluded. Microsoft and other third-party software retains
its own terms and is not relicensed by the project GPL grant. See
LICENSING.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for component boundaries.
